{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "area-chart",
  "title": "Area chart",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 4.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A filled line over time, drawn from data: one series against a dashed comparison, up to four series stacked into a total, or steps for a value that changes in jumps. Legend items switch series on and off; the crosshair reads every series at once.",
    "id": "Garis berisi isian sepanjang waktu, digambar dari data: satu seri dengan pembanding putus-putus, sampai empat seri bertumpuk menjadi total, atau anak tangga untuk nilai yang berubah dengan lompatan. Item legenda menyalakan dan mematikan seri; crosshair membaca semua seri sekaligus."
  },
  "titleId": "Area chart",
  "react": true,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "This month against last month",
        "desc": "One filled series and a dashed comparison. The fill grows from the baseline on first view; the dashed line fades in. Point at the plot, or focus it and use the arrow keys.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-visits\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-visits\">Are more people riding the city bus?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Passengers per day, November against October</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"City bus passengers per day. This month 27,830, 18% more than last month.\",\"x\":[\"18 Oct\",\"19 Oct\",\"20 Oct\",\"21 Oct\",\"22 Oct\",\"23 Oct\",\"24 Oct\",\"25 Oct\",\"26 Oct\",\"27 Oct\",\"28 Oct\",\"29 Oct\",\"30 Oct\",\"31 Oct\",\"1 Nov\",\"2 Nov\",\"3 Nov\",\"4 Nov\",\"5 Nov\",\"6 Nov\",\"7 Nov\",\"8 Nov\",\"9 Nov\",\"10 Nov\",\"11 Nov\",\"12 Nov\",\"13 Nov\",\"14 Nov\",\"15 Nov\",\"16 Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"Sun 18 Oct\",\"Mon 19 Oct\",\"Tue 20 Oct\",\"Wed 21 Oct\",\"Thu 22 Oct\",\"Fri 23 Oct\",\"Sat 24 Oct\",\"Sun 25 Oct\",\"Mon 26 Oct\",\"Tue 27 Oct\",\"Wed 28 Oct\",\"Thu 29 Oct\",\"Fri 30 Oct\",\"Sat 31 Oct\",\"Sun 1 Nov\",\"Mon 2 Nov\",\"Tue 3 Nov\",\"Wed 4 Nov\",\"Thu 5 Nov\",\"Fri 6 Nov\",\"Sat 7 Nov\",\"Sun 8 Nov\",\"Mon 9 Nov\",\"Tue 10 Nov\",\"Wed 11 Nov\",\"Thu 12 Nov\",\"Fri 13 Nov\",\"Sat 14 Nov\",\"Sun 15 Nov\",\"Mon 16 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Day\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"This month\",\"values\":[870,920,930,870,820,670,720,910,980,1050,1010,890,750,760,910,1050,1110,980,920,730,870,900,1090,1150,1070,930,850,900,1000,1220]},{\"name\":\"Last month\",\"values\":[800,870,930,830,690,580,620,820,870,860,860,720,680,620,790,920,910,810,700,610,700,830,930,920,900,750,710,710,750,920],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":4}]}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Stacked into a total",
        "desc": "Three channels stack into all complaints. Switch a channel off in the legend: its band collapses and the scale eases to the new total. The tooltip lists the top band first, then the total.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-devices\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-devices\">How do residents send complaints?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Complaints per day by channel, last 14 days</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Citizen complaints per day by channel, last 14 days. The phone app carries more than half of all complaints.\",\"x\":[\"3 Nov\",\"4 Nov\",\"5 Nov\",\"6 Nov\",\"7 Nov\",\"8 Nov\",\"9 Nov\",\"10 Nov\",\"11 Nov\",\"12 Nov\",\"13 Nov\",\"14 Nov\",\"15 Nov\",\"16 Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"Tue 3 Nov\",\"Wed 4 Nov\",\"Thu 5 Nov\",\"Fri 6 Nov\",\"Sat 7 Nov\",\"Sun 8 Nov\",\"Mon 9 Nov\",\"Tue 10 Nov\",\"Wed 11 Nov\",\"Thu 12 Nov\",\"Fri 13 Nov\",\"Sat 14 Nov\",\"Sun 15 Nov\",\"Mon 16 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Day\",\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true,\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Phone app\",\"values\":[405,435,450,465,390,385,410,460,505,510,510,475,430,485]},{\"name\":\"Website\",\"values\":[250,330,345,285,230,170,205,250,315,335,305,240,175,215]},{\"name\":\"Phone call\",\"values\":[65,80,80,75,65,60,60,65,75,80,75,70,65,60]}]}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Steps and a reference line",
        "desc": "Slots change in jumps and hold between bookings, so the edge steps instead of sloping. The dashed line marks when the waitlist opens.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 560px;\"><section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-seats\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-seats\">How fast are vaccination slots filling?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Slots left on Monday, by hour</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Vaccination slots left for Saturday, by hour of Monday. Down from 120 to 34.\",\"x\":[\"08:00\",\"09:00\",\"10:00\",\"11:00\",\"12:00\",\"13:00\",\"14:00\",\"15:00\",\"16:00\",\"17:00\",\"18:00\"],\"xName\":\"Time\",\"step\":true,\"height\":200,\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Slots left\",\"values\":[120,118,104,96,96,81,77,60,52,41,34]}],\"refs\":[{\"value\":40,\"label\":\"Waitlist opens at 40\"}],\"y\":{\"max\":120,\"ticks\":4}}'></div>\n</section></div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Bulan ini dibanding bulan lalu",
        "desc": "Satu seri berisi dan pembanding putus-putus. Isian tumbuh dari garis dasar saat pertama terlihat; garis putus-putus muncul memudar. Arahkan kursor ke plot, atau fokuskan lalu pakai tombol panah.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-visits\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-visits\">Apakah penumpang bus kota bertambah?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Penumpang per hari, November dibanding Oktober</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Penumpang bus kota per hari. Bulan ini 27.830, 18% lebih banyak dari bulan lalu.\",\"x\":[\"18 Okt\",\"19 Okt\",\"20 Okt\",\"21 Okt\",\"22 Okt\",\"23 Okt\",\"24 Okt\",\"25 Okt\",\"26 Okt\",\"27 Okt\",\"28 Okt\",\"29 Okt\",\"30 Okt\",\"31 Okt\",\"1 Nov\",\"2 Nov\",\"3 Nov\",\"4 Nov\",\"5 Nov\",\"6 Nov\",\"7 Nov\",\"8 Nov\",\"9 Nov\",\"10 Nov\",\"11 Nov\",\"12 Nov\",\"13 Nov\",\"14 Nov\",\"15 Nov\",\"16 Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"Min 18 Okt\",\"Sen 19 Okt\",\"Sel 20 Okt\",\"Rab 21 Okt\",\"Kam 22 Okt\",\"Jum 23 Okt\",\"Sab 24 Okt\",\"Min 25 Okt\",\"Sen 26 Okt\",\"Sel 27 Okt\",\"Rab 28 Okt\",\"Kam 29 Okt\",\"Jum 30 Okt\",\"Sab 31 Okt\",\"Min 1 Nov\",\"Sen 2 Nov\",\"Sel 3 Nov\",\"Rab 4 Nov\",\"Kam 5 Nov\",\"Jum 6 Nov\",\"Sab 7 Nov\",\"Min 8 Nov\",\"Sen 9 Nov\",\"Sel 10 Nov\",\"Rab 11 Nov\",\"Kam 12 Nov\",\"Jum 13 Nov\",\"Sab 14 Nov\",\"Min 15 Nov\",\"Sen 16 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Hari\",\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Bulan ini\",\"values\":[870,920,930,870,820,670,720,910,980,1050,1010,890,750,760,910,1050,1110,980,920,730,870,900,1090,1150,1070,930,850,900,1000,1220]},{\"name\":\"Bulan lalu\",\"values\":[800,870,930,830,690,580,620,820,870,860,860,720,680,620,790,920,910,810,700,610,700,830,930,920,900,750,710,710,750,920],\"kind\":\"line\",\"dashed\":true,\"color\":4}]}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bertumpuk menjadi total",
        "desc": "Tiga saluran bertumpuk menjadi seluruh pengaduan. Matikan satu saluran di legenda: pitanya menyusut dan skala berpindah halus ke total baru. Tooltip mencantumkan pita teratas lebih dulu, lalu totalnya.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-devices\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-devices\">Lewat mana warga mengadu?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Pengaduan per hari menurut saluran, 14 hari terakhir</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Pengaduan warga per hari menurut saluran, 14 hari terakhir. Aplikasi ponsel menampung lebih dari separuh pengaduan.\",\"x\":[\"3 Nov\",\"4 Nov\",\"5 Nov\",\"6 Nov\",\"7 Nov\",\"8 Nov\",\"9 Nov\",\"10 Nov\",\"11 Nov\",\"12 Nov\",\"13 Nov\",\"14 Nov\",\"15 Nov\",\"16 Nov\"],\"xFull\":[\"Sel 3 Nov\",\"Rab 4 Nov\",\"Kam 5 Nov\",\"Jum 6 Nov\",\"Sab 7 Nov\",\"Min 8 Nov\",\"Sen 9 Nov\",\"Sel 10 Nov\",\"Rab 11 Nov\",\"Kam 12 Nov\",\"Jum 13 Nov\",\"Sab 14 Nov\",\"Min 15 Nov\",\"Sen 16 Nov\"],\"xName\":\"Hari\",\"stacked\":true,\"total\":true,\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Aplikasi ponsel\",\"values\":[405,435,450,465,390,385,410,460,505,510,510,475,430,485]},{\"name\":\"Situs web\",\"values\":[250,330,345,285,230,170,205,250,315,335,305,240,175,215]},{\"name\":\"Telepon\",\"values\":[65,80,80,75,65,60,60,65,75,80,75,70,65,60]}]}'></div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Anak tangga dan garis acuan",
        "desc": "Kuota berubah dengan lompatan dan bertahan di antara pendaftaran, jadi tepinya berundak, bukan miring. Garis putus-putus menandai saat daftar tunggu dibuka.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 560px;\"><section class=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"ac-seats\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"ac-seats\">Seberapa cepat kuota vaksinasi terisi?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Sisa kuota pada hari Senin, per jam</div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart\" data-lds-chart='{\"label\":\"Sisa kuota vaksinasi hari Sabtu, per jam pada hari Senin. Turun dari 120 ke 34.\",\"x\":[\"08.00\",\"09.00\",\"10.00\",\"11.00\",\"12.00\",\"13.00\",\"14.00\",\"15.00\",\"16.00\",\"17.00\",\"18.00\"],\"xName\":\"Jam\",\"step\":true,\"height\":200,\"series\":[{\"name\":\"Sisa kuota\",\"values\":[120,118,104,96,96,81,77,60,52,41,34]}],\"refs\":[{\"value\":40,\"label\":\"Daftar tunggu dibuka di 40\"}],\"y\":{\"max\":120,\"ticks\":4}}'></div>\n</section></div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "reactUsage": "import { Chart, Segmented } from 'lampung-design-system/react';\n\nconst [period, setPeriod] = useState<'7d' | '30d'>('30d');\n<section className=\"chart-card\" aria-labelledby=\"orders-q\">\n  <div className=\"chart-card__head\">\n    <div className=\"chart-card__titles\"><div className=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"orders-q\">How do residents send complaints?</div></div>\n    <div className=\"chart-card__actions\"><Segmented className=\"chart-card__range\" label=\"Period\" value={period} onChange={setPeriod} options={[{ value: '7d', label: '7 days' }, { value: '30d', label: '30 days' }]} /></div>\n  </div>\n  <Chart config={{ label: 'Complaints per day by channel', stacked: true, x: data[period].x, series: data[period].series }} />\n</section>",
  "related": [
    "chart-card",
    "line-chart",
    "bar-chart",
    "chart-principles"
  ]
}
